Deterministic data-contract, bundle and verification tools for the SELVEDGE research program. Commands never mutate an input artifact and print typed errors instead of guessing.

Usage: selvedge <COMMAND>

Commands:
  admit          Admit a declared selection path against the active-parameter ceiling
  doctor         Probe the environment, config, schema versions and toolchain identity
  inspect        Print a shard table for a bundle or a bare manifest. Read-only
  inspect-model  Account the exact learned parameters and FLOPs of a real checkpoint
  format         Versioned bundle format commands
  convert        Convert a safetensors SwiGLU checkpoint into repacked group bundles
  court          Run the executable verification courts
  atlas          Atlas selector fit, select and matched-budget compare
  store          Tiered shard store commands (exact-mode bench)
  io-scan        Measure physical I/O on an existing file
  help           Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')

  -V, --version
          Print version
